message: >-
  Cite the Adaptive Orchestration Protocol source and preserve the applicable
  license, author attribution and change notice. The current protocol version
  is 6.7; independent repository promotion preserves its prior lineage.
title: "Adaptive Orchestration Protocol"
type: software
version: "6.7"
