abstract: >-
  Adaptive Orchestration Protocol is a model-neutral method for routing AI
  work across control roots, execution surfaces, capability, behavioral fit,
  decision commitment, effort and delegation while preserving continuity,
  evidence, convergence and acceptance. It originated in Moon Source and is
  independently versioned at 6.7.
keywords:
  - AI orchestration
  - execution routing
  - delegation
  - human-AI collaboration
  - decision commitment
